# Copy to .env and fill in. See the comments in that file for what each one does.
#
# build-zip.ps1 mirrors .env to env.txt, which is what the extension falls back
# to if Chrome refuses to serve the dotfile. Both are gitignored; edit .env.
#
#   CURSOR    true / false — the hand-steered on-page cursor and its pinch click.
#             false hides it from the UI entirely as well as switching it off.
#   AI        Groq API key (console.groq.com/keys), which is what understands
#             what you say to the voice pill and works the page for you. Blank
#             is fine; Jester says the key is missing rather than failing
#             silently later, and everything else keeps working without it.
#   AI_MODEL  Optional. A Groq model id to put at the front of Jester's list.
#             Choose on the token-per-minute allowance rather than on speed:
#             describing a page is the biggest thing Jester sends, and a
#             command spends two or three of them inside one minute. Blank is
#             the right answer for most people.

CURSOR=true
AI=
AI_MODEL=
